WEBVTT

﻿1

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:26.567
Not bad.


00:01:26.569 --> 00:01:28.703
You got to twist your hips,
like this.


00:01:32.909 --> 00:01:35.843
You got a little "Saturday Night
Fever" going there, Frankie.


00:01:35.845 --> 00:01:38.212
Rockin' the platform heels
there, too.


00:01:38.214 --> 00:01:39.247
Am I right?


00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:44.854
So, this hip explodes forward,
and the back foot swivels.


00:01:46.556 --> 00:01:48.022
That's where
your power comes from.


00:01:48.024 --> 00:01:49.092
Yeah.
Yeah, I see.


00:01:56.066 --> 00:01:58.634
Let me try that again.


00:02:07.143 --> 00:02:09.611
Let me show you.


00:02:10.113 --> 00:02:11.712
The bottom hand


00:02:11.714 --> 00:02:12.914
is your direction.


00:02:12.916 --> 00:02:14.715
Got it.


00:02:14.717 --> 00:02:16.317
Max, please!


00:02:16.319 --> 00:02:17.718
I swear, if I knew anything...


00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:18.852
- Hey! Shut up!
- ...I'd tell you.


00:02:18.854 --> 00:02:20.054
Fuck!


00:02:20.056 --> 00:02:21.555
I'm trying
to concentrate, Jimmy.


00:02:21.557 --> 00:02:22.589
All right.


00:02:22.591 --> 00:02:23.857
Max!
Max, I swear. Max!


00:02:23.859 --> 00:02:25.126
I swear on my mother's life!


00:02:28.264 --> 00:02:30.298
Oh.
You just told me...


00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:33.168
Okay.
All right.


00:02:35.137 --> 00:02:36.670
Shut up!


00:02:38.607 --> 00:02:39.639
Please!


00:02:39.641 --> 00:02:42.009
I'll tell you anything.


00:02:42.011 --> 00:02:44.177
What did I just say?!


00:02:59.795 --> 00:03:01.695
Fuck!


00:03:01.697 --> 00:03:04.231
I'll get that.


00:03:12.041 --> 00:03:13.940
You go that way.
I'll check over here.


00:03:13.942 --> 00:03:16.111
20 bucks
to whoever finds it first.


00:03:27.389 --> 00:03:28.954
Found it.


00:03:28.956 --> 00:03:30.689
Looks like
you owe me some money.


00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:34.827
Listen, I'm gonna stay out here
and have a smoke,


00:03:34.829 --> 00:03:36.129
try not to go deaf.


00:03:36.131 --> 00:03:37.264
I hear that.


00:03:37.266 --> 00:03:38.664
Do your thing, man.


00:03:38.666 --> 00:03:39.901
All right.


00:03:55.883 --> 00:03:58.284
You fucking piece of...


00:03:58.286 --> 00:04:00.319
Hey!


00:04:43.063 --> 00:04:46.432
I'm prescribing GHB
to help manage your insomnia,


00:04:46.434 --> 00:04:48.334
but it is
a controlled substance, so...


00:04:48.336 --> 00:04:50.935
I won't need it.
I'm fine.


00:04:50.937 --> 00:04:54.038
Prolonged insomnia
will lead to confusion,


00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:55.707
delirium, hallucinations,


00:04:55.709 --> 00:04:57.242
and ultimately
dementia and death,


00:04:57.244 --> 00:05:00.414
so it's critical
you at least try to sleep.


00:05:02.849 --> 00:05:04.883
You're not gonna
fill that, are you?


00:05:04.885 --> 00:05:06.451
I don't think
you're taking to heart


00:05:06.453 --> 00:05:08.153
the seriousness
of this disease.


00:05:08.155 --> 00:05:09.487
It's the reason


00:05:09.489 --> 00:05:12.290
you're being released
from prison early.


00:05:17.197 --> 00:05:20.131
Just take these
until you see the specialist.


00:05:20.133 --> 00:05:22.433
If you don't sleep,
you will die.


00:05:22.435 --> 00:05:23.735
Do you hear
what I'm saying to you?


00:05:23.737 --> 00:05:24.936
Yes.


00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:28.973
Give this to your P.O.


00:05:28.975 --> 00:05:31.276
so he knows
the medication's cleared.


00:05:33.246 --> 00:05:34.811
Take care, Frank.


00:05:34.813 --> 00:05:36.416
Thanks, Doc.


00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:03.528
Joey?


00:08:14.305 --> 00:08:16.306
I figured
you wouldn't be here.


00:08:18.141 --> 00:08:19.544
Well, I'm here.


00:08:20.645 --> 00:08:22.377
Look at you.
You look...


00:08:22.379 --> 00:08:25.313
What? 19 years older than
the last time you saw me?


00:08:25.315 --> 00:08:28.283
Well, yeah.
You look like a man now.


00:08:28.285 --> 00:08:29.319
Because I am.


00:08:32.356 --> 00:08:34.923
- Let me get that for you.
- No, I can carry it.


00:08:34.925 --> 00:08:36.860
- Are you sure?
- Really, it's not that heavy.


00:08:38.095 --> 00:08:39.996
Fine.


00:08:41.164 --> 00:08:43.465
So I guess we're walking?


00:08:43.467 --> 00:08:45.266
Well, I had to sell the car
to pay off some stuff.


00:08:45.268 --> 00:08:47.602
- You know, bills and shit.
- I'm kidding.


00:08:47.604 --> 00:08:49.270
I don't mind walking.


00:08:49.272 --> 00:08:53.143
I don't normally get
a lot of time outside, so...


00:09:12.729 --> 00:09:15.129
You sure I can't
get you something to eat,


00:09:15.131 --> 00:09:18.633
compliments of the Grand Bend
Correctional Facility payroll?


00:09:18.635 --> 00:09:20.067
No. I'm good.


00:09:20.069 --> 00:09:21.636
You sure? I mean,
look how skinny you are.


00:09:21.638 --> 00:09:23.971
You look like you haven't
had a decent meal in months.


00:09:23.973 --> 00:09:25.005
What's that
supposed to mean?


00:09:25.007 --> 00:09:27.074
Nothing. I just...


00:09:27.076 --> 00:09:28.643
I mean, it's on me,
that's all.


00:09:28.645 --> 00:09:32.246
You know, a dad likes
to buy stuff for his kid.


00:09:32.248 --> 00:09:33.315
I didn't mean anything else.


00:09:39.054 --> 00:09:41.221
The coffee
tastes the same, but...


00:09:42.425 --> 00:09:45.325
...the air
sure smells different.


00:09:45.327 --> 00:09:48.295
And it's nice just to have
a normal pair of clothes on,


00:09:48.297 --> 00:09:49.430
you know?


00:09:49.432 --> 00:09:51.398
Even those?


00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.434
Well, I guess they are
kind of out of date, huh?


00:09:53.436 --> 00:09:54.768
I mean, 'cause that's
what you were wearing


00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:56.372
when they hauled you away.


00:10:04.513 --> 00:10:06.280
Take US 20 towards Salem,


00:10:06.282 --> 00:10:08.148
and I'll give you
directions from there.


00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:09.483
What the fuck you want
to go out there for?


00:10:09.485 --> 00:10:11.151
I just want to look
at the old house.


00:10:11.153 --> 00:10:13.253
Been a long time
since I've seen it.


00:10:13.255 --> 00:10:16.958
Fine.
Whatever you want.


00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:34.040
You know somebody else
lives there now.


00:10:34.042 --> 00:10:36.042
The family.


00:10:36.044 --> 00:10:38.112
I just want to take
a look around.


00:10:40.649 --> 00:10:42.448
I'm only gonna be a second.


00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:45.453
I just want to see if
something I left is still there.


00:13:23.476 --> 00:13:24.842
What the hell
took you so long?


00:13:24.844 --> 00:13:25.745
Oh...


00:13:29.715 --> 00:13:31.248
What happened to you?


00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:32.652
Nothing.


00:13:33.786 --> 00:13:35.519
Look what I found.


00:13:35.521 --> 00:13:38.255
- No shit.
- Unbelievable, right?


00:13:38.257 --> 00:13:39.423
It was like
my prized possession.


00:13:39.425 --> 00:13:40.791
Not that I would've known,


00:13:40.793 --> 00:13:42.693
the way you wouldn't let
anyone else touch it,


00:13:42.695 --> 00:13:45.228
and only held it yourself
with gloves on.


00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:47.263
Yeah, or, like, tweezers.


00:13:47.265 --> 00:13:48.465
Can't believe you found it.


00:13:48.467 --> 00:13:49.833
It's still
in amazing condition.


00:13:49.835 --> 00:13:52.670
- It is.
- Probably worth a lot.


00:13:52.672 --> 00:13:53.839
Yeah.


00:13:54.974 --> 00:13:56.874
Wonder what
I could sell it for.


00:13:56.876 --> 00:13:59.242
I mean, it's got to be
a collector's item, right?


00:13:59.244 --> 00:14:01.745
Please, don't sell it.


00:14:01.747 --> 00:14:03.312
If you don't want it,


00:14:03.314 --> 00:14:05.314
I'd like to keep it,
if you don't mind.


00:14:05.316 --> 00:14:07.751
I'll give you the money for it,
if you want.


00:14:07.753 --> 00:14:08.888
Okay.


00:14:11.957 --> 00:14:13.356
So where to now?


00:14:13.358 --> 00:14:14.892
Well...


00:14:14.894 --> 00:14:17.527
You and I
are gonna live it up.


00:15:34.605 --> 00:15:36.105
What are we doing here?


00:15:36.107 --> 00:15:38.007
Meeting my parole officer.


00:15:39.777 --> 00:15:41.843
We're checking in!


00:15:41.845 --> 00:15:44.548
Compliments of
the prison payroll?


00:15:45.749 --> 00:15:47.816
After a $300 cab ride,
I don't think so.


00:15:47.818 --> 00:15:49.050
I got it covered.


00:15:49.052 --> 00:15:50.587
Keep the change.


00:15:53.624 --> 00:15:55.524
You're using their money,
aren't you?


00:15:55.526 --> 00:15:56.992
After everything
they did to you?


00:15:56.994 --> 00:15:58.493
After everything they did
to us?


00:15:58.495 --> 00:16:01.062
Hell, yes,
after everything they did to us.


00:16:01.064 --> 00:16:02.597
After everything
they did to us,


00:16:02.599 --> 00:16:04.633
I'm gonna use
every last dollar.


00:16:04.635 --> 00:16:06.134
That's the least
they owe us.


00:16:06.136 --> 00:16:07.035
Okay.


00:16:07.037 --> 00:16:08.637
Well, knock yourself out.


00:16:08.639 --> 00:16:09.838
I don't want
any part of it.


00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:11.840
Joey! No.
Joey, don't go, please.


00:16:11.842 --> 00:16:13.975
Look, I want
to show you something.


00:16:13.977 --> 00:16:15.043
Look at this.


00:16:15.045 --> 00:16:16.611
Your mother brought me here


00:16:16.613 --> 00:16:18.980
as a surprise
for our second anniversary,


00:16:18.982 --> 00:16:20.447
and I was pissed


00:16:20.449 --> 00:16:21.750
because we didn't have
a dime between us


00:16:21.752 --> 00:16:23.450
but she said
none of that mattered,


00:16:23.452 --> 00:16:26.087
we can work out anything
as long as we're together.


00:16:26.089 --> 00:16:28.757
And I always wanted
to bring her back here, but I...


00:16:28.759 --> 00:16:30.558
I didn't get
around to it, did I?


00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:32.593
But the only thing
I thought about


00:16:32.595 --> 00:16:35.696
for every minute of every day
since I got locked up


00:16:35.698 --> 00:16:37.431
was how much I wanted
to bring you here.


00:16:37.433 --> 00:16:40.001
So please... please stay.


00:16:40.003 --> 00:16:42.438
You're all I got left.


00:16:46.076 --> 00:16:47.942
- Fine.
- All right.


00:16:47.944 --> 00:16:49.478
All right.


00:16:52.082 --> 00:16:54.149
That's for you.


00:16:54.151 --> 00:16:55.618
For you.


00:17:06.896 --> 00:17:09.398
Thanks.
We'll take it from here.


00:17:10.833 --> 00:17:12.535
Hey, hey.


00:17:13.836 --> 00:17:16.503
Nice!


00:17:16.505 --> 00:17:17.738
This is a step up


00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:20.142
from my previous
accommodations, right?


00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:28.581
Joey!
Six shower heads!


00:17:28.583 --> 00:17:31.087
It's our own personal spa.


00:17:34.589 --> 00:17:36.456
We're well stocked.


00:17:36.458 --> 00:17:37.958
Want a drink?


00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:39.461
No, I'm good.


00:17:45.134 --> 00:17:47.634
Oh!


00:17:47.636 --> 00:17:50.104
Oh, my God.


00:17:50.106 --> 00:17:52.705
Oh, you have no idea how hard
prison mattresses are.


00:17:52.707 --> 00:17:54.174
I don't even think


00:17:54.176 --> 00:17:56.609
they're stuffed with cotton
or whatever, just rocks.


00:17:56.611 --> 00:17:58.945
Come on. Lie down.
You got to feel this.


00:17:58.947 --> 00:18:00.949
- I'm good.
- Come on!


00:18:05.254 --> 00:18:06.721
Joey!


00:18:09.658 --> 00:18:11.891
Well, I'm gonna
take a shower,


00:18:11.893 --> 00:18:14.027
and then let's
grab some dinner.


00:18:14.029 --> 00:18:17.030
What do you think?
Does that sound good?


00:18:17.032 --> 00:18:18.433
Joey?


00:19:12.653 --> 00:19:14.720
Now, Joey,


00:19:14.722 --> 00:19:16.989
I want you to order
whatever you want.


00:19:16.991 --> 00:19:18.957
Spare no expense.


00:19:18.959 --> 00:19:21.960
I am treating you
to the best week of your life.


00:19:21.962 --> 00:19:24.563
- Dad...
- Whatever you want, you got it.


00:19:24.565 --> 00:19:26.832
It all looks so good.


00:19:26.834 --> 00:19:29.034
So get two things.
Get three!


00:19:29.036 --> 00:19:30.902
I'm not sure
I'm all that hungry.


00:19:30.904 --> 00:19:33.238
How can you not be hungry?


00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:34.842
You haven't eaten all day.


00:19:37.244 --> 00:19:38.710
I just meant...


00:19:38.712 --> 00:19:40.645
You know I've never
been a big eater.


00:19:40.647 --> 00:19:41.880
- I know.
- Even when I was a kid.


00:19:41.882 --> 00:19:43.581
I know.


00:19:43.583 --> 00:19:45.583
For your information,
I've been clean for a while now.


00:19:45.585 --> 00:19:47.154
I didn't mean anything by it.


00:19:49.589 --> 00:19:51.655
So catch me up on your life.


00:19:51.657 --> 00:19:53.258
I want to know everything
that's been going on.


00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.993
You got a girl?


00:19:54.995 --> 00:19:56.962
You know, it's kind of hard
to sum up 19 years


00:19:56.964 --> 00:19:59.797
in one dinner conversation.


00:19:59.799 --> 00:20:01.266
Where are you going?


00:20:01.268 --> 00:20:02.733
Bathroom.
Just order me whatever.


00:20:02.735 --> 00:20:04.735
- I upset you. I'm sorry.
- No, I'm not upset!


00:20:04.737 --> 00:20:07.905
I have to piss.
That okay with you?


00:20:07.907 --> 00:20:09.974
Joey.


00:20:09.976 --> 00:20:12.177
Come on.
Sit with your old man!


00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:43.142
Thank you.


00:20:46.112 --> 00:20:47.847
Thank you.


00:20:49.115 --> 00:20:50.748
I love this place.


00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:52.750
It's very nice.


00:20:52.752 --> 00:20:55.820
How've you been?
I've been really well.


00:20:55.822 --> 00:20:57.221
- It's good to see you.
- You too.


00:20:57.223 --> 00:20:59.156
Guy's old enough
to be her grandfather.


00:20:59.158 --> 00:21:00.791
What took you so long?


00:21:00.793 --> 00:21:02.359
Looks even older than you.


00:21:02.361 --> 00:21:04.895
See?
There's hope for me yet.


00:21:04.897 --> 00:21:07.298
Yeah, if you got
two G's to burn.


00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:08.665
What?
You think she's...


00:21:08.667 --> 00:21:11.035
- A prostitute, yeah.
- Come on!


00:21:11.037 --> 00:21:16.006
Just saying.
Times have changed, old man.


00:21:17.742 --> 00:21:19.978
How many times
have you been there?


00:21:25.284 --> 00:21:28.118
I don't know why I didn't
bring any clothes with me.


00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:30.053
We'll go shopping
for some tomorrow.


00:21:30.055 --> 00:21:31.257
Okay.


00:21:32.757 --> 00:21:34.391
I just want to say good night.


00:21:34.393 --> 00:21:36.259
Good night.


00:21:36.261 --> 00:21:38.828
Hey.
Um...


00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.866
Can I show you something?


00:21:45.704 --> 00:21:46.872
I hope you like it.


00:21:52.144 --> 00:21:54.077
Solid maple.


00:21:54.079 --> 00:21:55.478
I made over 40 of them.


00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:56.980
- You made them?
- Yeah.


00:21:56.982 --> 00:21:58.448
And I actually had
orders come in


00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.718
from all over the country
at one time.


00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:03.920
I ended up coaching inside,


00:22:03.922 --> 00:22:05.221
and it reminded me


00:22:05.223 --> 00:22:06.856
of when you used to play
Little League


00:22:06.858 --> 00:22:09.758
and I'd help out
every now and again.


00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:12.195
I wish I had made more time
for it back then.


00:22:12.197 --> 00:22:14.364
I hated playing, anyways.


00:22:14.366 --> 00:22:16.933
No, you didn't.
You loved it.


00:22:16.935 --> 00:22:18.867
You were good at it, too.


00:22:18.869 --> 00:22:21.339
You could've made it
to the big leagues.


00:22:34.919 --> 00:22:37.021
That's not
how I remember it.


00:22:40.224 --> 00:22:43.361
Yeah, you could've,
if you'd stuck with it.


00:22:47.898 --> 00:22:49.331
Well, did you make
this one too?


00:22:49.333 --> 00:22:54.004
No. That's birch.
Not nearly as good as maple.


00:22:57.208 --> 00:22:59.474
I know I was never any good
at the whole father thing.


00:22:59.476 --> 00:23:01.310
- Dad, don't.
- No. It's true.


00:23:01.312 --> 00:23:04.079
I stank as a dad,
but I'm gonna make it up to you


00:23:04.081 --> 00:23:06.348
for being gone
when you really needed me.


00:23:06.350 --> 00:23:08.352
Yeah, like my entire life.


00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:17.893
Are you planning
on getting revenge?


00:23:17.895 --> 00:23:19.897
What? No.


00:23:21.098 --> 00:23:22.433
Really?


00:23:24.101 --> 00:23:26.901
I'm done with those people.


00:23:26.903 --> 00:23:28.503
I'm done with all of it.


00:23:28.505 --> 00:23:29.904
I'm just making sure


00:23:29.906 --> 00:23:31.839
I get you and me right
this time.


00:23:31.841 --> 00:23:34.911
You're stuck with me,
whether you like it or not.


00:23:36.946 --> 00:23:40.217
And I'm never
leaving you again.


00:24:33.369 --> 00:24:35.202
Where do you think
you're going, Pops?


00:24:35.204 --> 00:24:37.071
I'm looking for Sleepy.
I'm a friend.


00:24:37.073 --> 00:24:38.472
I think you're in
the wrong place.


00:24:38.474 --> 00:24:40.974
I don't know who the fuck
you're talking about.


00:24:40.976 --> 00:24:43.477
- That's a 226 clone.
- Yeah.


00:24:43.479 --> 00:24:45.912
You want to see it up close?
Want to suck on it?


00:24:45.914 --> 00:24:47.981
You kids like them because
you think they look cool.


00:24:47.983 --> 00:24:49.350
Truth is, it's one of


00:24:49.352 --> 00:24:51.151
the most unreliable firearms
in the world.


00:24:51.153 --> 00:24:53.019
Sights are crude,
weight's all wrong,


00:24:53.021 --> 00:24:54.488
the design's
entirely impractical,


00:24:54.490 --> 00:24:56.657
and if you don't have
just the right ammunition,


00:24:56.659 --> 00:24:57.991
it's guaranteed
to jam up on you.


00:24:57.993 --> 00:24:59.427
Come on, kid, take it easy.


00:24:59.429 --> 00:25:01.495
I'm just here to do
some business with Sleepy.


00:25:01.497 --> 00:25:06.433
Sleepy's been
dead for six years.


00:25:06.435 --> 00:25:09.471
Doesn't change
what I'm bringing to the table.


00:25:11.641 --> 00:25:13.406
So you're in charge now?


