00:41:42.983 --> 00:41:47.052
Really.
I swear.


00:41:47.054 --> 00:41:48.920
Well, I think
it's kind of sexy.


00:41:48.922 --> 00:41:51.923
Huh.
Yeah, right.


00:41:51.925 --> 00:41:54.159
So, what did you do?


00:41:54.161 --> 00:41:56.629
Did you kill a man?


00:41:56.631 --> 00:41:59.164
Was it over a woman?


00:41:59.166 --> 00:42:02.467
Honestly,
I'd rather not say.


00:42:06.406 --> 00:42:08.041
I was just intrigued.


00:42:10.577 --> 00:42:12.612
What? You're really not
gonna tell me?


00:42:14.247 --> 00:42:16.950
Now I'm not so sure
about the "harmless" part.


00:42:27.027 --> 00:42:29.060
Here's a thousand for the hour.


00:42:29.062 --> 00:42:32.263
And another thousand
for being nice.


00:42:32.265 --> 00:42:35.500
You really know how
to make a girl feel special.


00:42:35.502 --> 00:42:37.404
I thought
that's how it works.


00:42:38.472 --> 00:42:39.937
It is.


00:42:39.939 --> 00:42:41.939
Wait. Wait.


00:42:41.941 --> 00:42:45.075
Jesus Christ,
I screw everything up.


00:42:45.077 --> 00:42:46.411
I'm sorry.


00:42:46.413 --> 00:42:48.045
Really.


00:42:48.047 --> 00:42:49.614
It's okay.


00:42:49.616 --> 00:42:52.249
Do you have to go?


00:42:52.251 --> 00:42:55.352
Do you have
a little more time for me?


00:42:55.354 --> 00:42:57.022
It'll cost you.


00:43:01.093 --> 00:43:02.426
Ha!


00:43:06.198 --> 00:43:09.368
Oh, no, no!
No, my scarf!


00:43:26.152 --> 00:43:29.219
I took the rap for my boss.


00:43:29.221 --> 00:43:31.588
He's the one
that killed the guy, so...


00:43:31.590 --> 00:43:34.358
He was a big-shot bagman
on the Upper East Side


00:43:34.360 --> 00:43:35.626
with a lot of friends.


00:43:35.628 --> 00:43:38.262
A lot of cop friends,
as it turned out.


00:43:38.264 --> 00:43:40.096
How'd he kill him?


00:43:40.098 --> 00:43:43.434
Ah, he beat his head in
with a baseball bat.


00:43:43.436 --> 00:43:45.369
Jesus.


00:43:45.371 --> 00:43:48.605
W-Why would you go to prison
for a man like that?


00:43:48.607 --> 00:43:49.642
Got a huge payout.


00:43:52.010 --> 00:43:54.378
That's just the way we did it
in my line of work.


00:43:54.380 --> 00:43:56.513
Or what used to be
my line of work.


00:43:56.515 --> 00:43:58.247
Did what you were told.


00:43:58.249 --> 00:44:01.050
You know, kept your mouth shut
and did what you're told.


00:44:01.052 --> 00:44:03.520
But that's horrible.


00:44:03.522 --> 00:44:05.455
Yes and no.


00:44:05.457 --> 00:44:08.324
At the time, the guy
was like family to me.


00:44:08.326 --> 00:44:10.594
We took care of each other.


00:44:10.596 --> 00:44:12.462
I looked after him.


00:44:12.464 --> 00:44:15.732
He looked after me
and my family.


00:44:15.734 --> 00:44:17.500
You have a wife and kids?


00:44:17.502 --> 00:44:20.069
My wife died a long time ago.


00:44:20.071 --> 00:44:21.370
Um...


00:44:21.372 --> 00:44:25.343
I just have the boy,
the one son.


00:44:26.744 --> 00:44:29.247
He's all grown up now.


00:44:30.281 --> 00:44:33.049
God, that must have been hard
for the both of you.


00:44:33.051 --> 00:44:35.518
I can't imagine being away
from my son


00:44:35.520 --> 00:44:37.119
for more than
a couple of days,


00:44:37.121 --> 00:44:39.190
let alone...


00:44:40.625 --> 00:44:42.358
- Shit.
- What?


00:44:42.360 --> 00:44:44.494
Nothing.
I just, um...


00:44:44.496 --> 00:44:48.063
I have a policy
of not telling my clients


00:44:48.065 --> 00:44:49.599
about my personal life.


00:44:49.601 --> 00:44:54.102
I keep it strictly business.


00:44:54.104 --> 00:44:56.240
Usually.


00:45:00.545 --> 00:45:03.146
But I guess
you're different.


00:45:29.841 --> 00:45:31.742
<i>You okay?</i>


00:45:34.611 --> 00:45:36.378
Yeah.


00:45:36.380 --> 00:45:37.779
You sure?


00:45:37.781 --> 00:45:39.550
You want me to stop?


00:46:03.807 --> 00:46:05.172
Oh...


00:46:23.660 --> 00:46:25.528
That's serious.


00:46:27.330 --> 00:46:29.630
It's a combat wound.


00:46:29.632 --> 00:46:31.565
Ah, World War II?


00:46:31.567 --> 00:46:32.934
Ha ha.


00:46:32.936 --> 00:46:34.468
Thanks.


00:46:34.470 --> 00:46:38.639
No, that was a, uh,
disgruntled client.


00:46:38.641 --> 00:46:40.676
Perils of the job.


00:46:42.211 --> 00:46:44.411
Wait,
someone fucking shot you?


00:46:44.413 --> 00:46:45.846
Yeah, they tried.


00:46:45.848 --> 00:46:48.349
Yeah, they succeeded!


00:46:48.351 --> 00:46:50.820
If they'd succeeded,
I'd be dead.


00:46:55.458 --> 00:46:57.393
Oh, I got something for you.


00:47:02.932 --> 00:47:04.632
Vitamin E.


00:47:04.634 --> 00:47:08.371
It, uh, it helps nourish
the scar tissue.


00:47:09.872 --> 00:47:14.240
No, seriously.
I use it all the time.


00:47:14.242 --> 00:47:16.677
W-What for?
Your skin looks perfect.


00:47:16.679 --> 00:47:19.615
Exactly.


00:47:20.783 --> 00:47:22.250
There.


00:47:25.453 --> 00:47:26.756
Thank you.


00:47:28.323 --> 00:47:29.925
You're welcome.


00:47:32.427 --> 00:47:34.262
Oh, right here's good.


00:47:35.630 --> 00:47:38.297
Let me get the door.
It's a little tricky.


00:47:41.804 --> 00:47:46.274
Well, thank you
for a lovely evening, Frank.


00:47:47.409 --> 00:47:48.842
Simone?


00:47:48.844 --> 00:47:51.444
Uh, I-I was thinking...


00:47:51.446 --> 00:47:54.747
I don't know, but maybe we could
do this again.


00:47:54.749 --> 00:47:56.516
Okay.


00:47:56.518 --> 00:47:58.518
All you got to do is call.


00:47:58.520 --> 00:48:01.423
I mean, without
the business side of things.


00:48:02.657 --> 00:48:03.692
Oh.


00:48:04.959 --> 00:48:07.627
I'm sorry.
That was stupid of me.


00:48:07.629 --> 00:48:09.996
I-I get a little carried away
sometimes.


00:48:09.998 --> 00:48:12.565
Oh, shit.
I broke your heart.


00:48:12.567 --> 00:48:14.367
What? No.
Not possible!


00:48:14.369 --> 00:48:15.802
It's made of cast iron.
See?


00:48:15.804 --> 00:48:17.370
Ah!


00:48:17.372 --> 00:48:20.673
Anyway, I'll, uh,
call your service tomorrow,


00:48:20.675 --> 00:48:22.475
and maybe we can have
some dinner,


00:48:22.477 --> 00:48:23.976
so I can make it up to you.


00:48:23.978 --> 00:48:25.277
Make what up to me?


00:48:25.279 --> 00:48:27.345
Me being a stupid old man.


00:48:28.415 --> 00:48:30.817
All right. Dinner.


00:48:30.819 --> 00:48:32.350
Tomorrow.


00:48:32.352 --> 00:48:34.921
Call the service.
You got the number.


00:48:34.923 --> 00:48:36.256
- I do.
- Okay.


00:48:37.826 --> 00:48:39.058
Hey, e-excuse me.


00:48:40.394 --> 00:48:41.996
Is Simone really your name?


00:48:43.665 --> 00:48:45.297
No.


00:48:45.299 --> 00:48:46.700
It's Jennifer.


00:49:54.400 --> 00:49:57.905
Hey, baby. You want to
play with the Dragon?


00:50:11.684 --> 00:50:14.752
I had no idea
this was your scene, Jimmy.


00:50:14.754 --> 00:50:16.587
It's the 21st century,
Frankie.


00:50:16.589 --> 00:50:18.823
A man can pamper himself.


00:50:18.825 --> 00:50:20.626
Indulge.


00:50:21.561 --> 00:50:22.728
Bitches, leave.


00:50:26.432 --> 00:50:30.401
Not nice to deprive a guy
of his happy ending.


00:50:30.403 --> 00:50:33.170
Prison life agreed with you.
You look fit.


00:50:33.172 --> 00:50:35.439
You dropped
a couple of pounds, I see.


00:50:35.441 --> 00:50:36.440
Cover up.


00:50:36.442 --> 00:50:37.808
What?


00:50:37.810 --> 00:50:39.443
Oh.


00:50:39.445 --> 00:50:42.146
Is that making you
uncomfortable?


00:50:42.148 --> 00:50:44.181
I can understand why.


00:50:44.183 --> 00:50:48.552
They don't call me the Dragon
because of my tattoo.


00:50:48.554 --> 00:50:51.088
Ah, you're a pretty smug
piece of shit


00:50:51.090 --> 00:50:53.657
for a guy who's got
a gun pointed at his head.


00:50:53.659 --> 00:50:54.792
It's not the first time.


00:50:54.794 --> 00:50:56.660
Probably won't be the last.


00:50:56.662 --> 00:50:58.028
Oh, it's your last.


00:50:58.030 --> 00:51:00.565
But you're gonna
explain something to me first.


00:51:01.566 --> 00:51:02.802
Then you might as well
shoot me.


00:51:04.937 --> 00:51:07.039
Because I haven't a clue
where Max has been hiding.


00:51:08.975 --> 00:51:10.042
Max...


00:51:11.978 --> 00:51:13.845
...is alive?


00:51:15.114 --> 00:51:17.647
Oh, shit.


00:51:52.117 --> 00:51:53.919
Just like the old days,
baby!


00:51:54.920 --> 00:51:56.420
Where do you think
you're going?


00:52:11.836 --> 00:52:13.972
Sorry, Frankie.
Nothing personal.


00:52:29.620 --> 00:52:31.520
Finally!


00:52:31.522 --> 00:52:33.590
You know how long I've been
waiting for you, young man?


00:52:37.027 --> 00:52:40.497
Thought you guys might've
ran off to Vegas to get married.


00:52:44.034 --> 00:52:46.635
So how was she?


00:52:46.637 --> 00:52:48.038
Was she incredible?


00:52:50.040 --> 00:52:51.206
You guys sleep at all,


00:52:51.208 --> 00:52:53.976
or you just at it
the whole time?


00:52:53.978 --> 00:52:55.310
Oh, nice.


00:52:55.312 --> 00:52:57.913
Your doctor gave you
the good stuff, huh?


00:53:03.687 --> 00:53:04.920
You gonna tell me anything?


00:53:04.922 --> 00:53:06.855
Can't talk
about it right now.


00:53:06.857 --> 00:53:08.190
Come on!


00:53:08.192 --> 00:53:09.725
First time you make mercury
in 19 years,


00:53:09.727 --> 00:53:11.193
and I don't get anything?


00:53:11.195 --> 00:53:12.930
Was she loud?


00:53:15.032 --> 00:53:16.133
What the hell
happened to you?


00:53:17.633 --> 00:53:20.936
Dad! What the hell
happened to you?


00:53:20.938 --> 00:53:22.838
- Answer me!
- What do you think happened?


00:53:22.840 --> 00:53:24.805
I met up with Jimmy the Dragon
and we had it out!


00:53:24.807 --> 00:53:26.807
- You killed him?
- Sadly, no.


00:53:26.809 --> 00:53:28.243
What the fuck?
You hid an arsenal in here


00:53:28.245 --> 00:53:29.610
the whole fucking time?


00:53:29.612 --> 00:53:30.945
You said you were
done with them!


00:53:30.947 --> 00:53:32.680
You said you weren't
looking to get even!


00:53:32.682 --> 00:53:34.915
Scores have to be settled.


00:53:34.917 --> 00:53:36.586
Says who?!


00:53:37.687 --> 00:53:39.087
You're a big fucking liar!


00:53:39.089 --> 00:53:41.223
- I'm doing this for you!
- That's bullshit!


00:53:41.225 --> 00:53:43.090
I am doing this for you!
Everything I do is for you!


00:53:43.092 --> 00:53:44.959
Oh, so it's all on me, huh?


00:53:44.961 --> 00:53:47.094
You getting locked up for two
fucking decades, that's on me?


00:53:47.096 --> 00:53:48.095
Yes!


00:53:48.097 --> 00:53:49.364
Because every penny I made,


00:53:49.366 --> 00:53:50.798
you took and you snorted
it up your nose


00:53:50.800 --> 00:53:52.700
and you shot it
in your veins!


00:53:52.702 --> 00:53:54.702
Oh, what?
Am I out of order?


00:53:54.704 --> 00:53:56.739
You think I'm fucking
using right now?


00:53:57.974 --> 00:53:59.273
Do you?


00:53:59.275 --> 00:54:00.708
Take a fucking look!


00:54:00.710 --> 00:54:03.310
Take a good fucking look!
All right?


00:54:03.312 --> 00:54:06.113
You satisfied, Detective?


00:54:06.115 --> 00:54:09.116
I don't understand why you care
all of a sudden.


00:54:09.118 --> 00:54:11.118
<i>Now</i> you want to teach me
right from wrong?


00:54:11.120 --> 00:54:13.788
Like you're my father?


00:54:13.790 --> 00:54:16.090
Like you're some shining
fucking example?


00:54:16.092 --> 00:54:17.892
- You better walk away.
- What are you gonna do?


00:54:17.894 --> 00:54:19.860
You're gonna knock me out?


00:54:19.862 --> 00:54:21.694
Huh?


00:54:21.696 --> 00:54:23.696
You know, why don't you reach
into that big black bag of yours


00:54:23.698 --> 00:54:24.731
and do it right?


00:54:24.733 --> 00:54:26.936
How about that, Dad?


00:54:28.637 --> 00:54:30.137
I got to go.


00:54:30.139 --> 00:54:32.139
You can lie to yourself
all you want,


00:54:32.141 --> 00:54:33.240
but I'm done with it!


00:54:33.242 --> 00:54:34.707
You hear me?


00:54:34.709 --> 00:54:36.177
You walk out that door
and I'm gone!


00:54:36.179 --> 00:54:37.644
That's it!


00:54:37.646 --> 00:54:40.249
You're never gonna
see me again.


00:56:01.028 --> 00:56:02.696
Frankie.


00:56:04.865 --> 00:56:06.299
Hiya, Tank.


00:56:06.301 --> 00:56:08.936
"Tank."


00:56:10.137 --> 00:56:13.205
Man, no one's called me that
in a long time.


00:56:14.875 --> 00:56:16.844
I heard you got out.


00:56:18.779 --> 00:56:20.915
I figured you'd come
looking for me.


00:56:24.818 --> 00:56:27.319
How you doing?


00:56:27.321 --> 00:56:29.288
Not too bad.


00:56:29.290 --> 00:56:31.892
- You?
- Can't complain.


00:56:33.294 --> 00:56:35.928
I mean, I've been having
some troubles with my hands


00:56:35.930 --> 00:56:38.030
a little bit.


00:56:38.032 --> 00:56:40.332
I think I may be
getting some arthritis.


00:56:40.334 --> 00:56:42.301
- That sucks.
- Ah, it happens.


00:56:42.303 --> 00:56:45.204
Makes working
kind of difficult.


00:56:45.206 --> 00:56:47.838
Never figured you the type
for legitimate work.


00:56:47.840 --> 00:56:49.408
Got to stay busy somehow,
right?


00:56:49.410 --> 00:56:52.112
It's not like I got a family
or anything. It's just me.


00:56:54.914 --> 00:56:57.982
Life never really turns out
the way you plan it.


00:56:57.984 --> 00:57:01.320
No. It doesn't.


00:57:01.322 --> 00:57:03.854
Anyway...


00:57:03.856 --> 00:57:07.392
You got to do
what you came here for, so...


00:57:07.394 --> 00:57:10.464
You're not gonna run?
Put up a fight?


00:57:11.432 --> 00:57:14.433
I figure I've outrun
what I got coming to me


00:57:14.435 --> 00:57:16.234
way longer
than I deserve.


00:57:16.236 --> 00:57:18.304
One thing first,
if you don't mind.


00:57:20.173 --> 00:57:22.139
Do you know
where I can find Max?


00:57:22.141 --> 00:57:24.342
I don't.


00:57:24.344 --> 00:57:27.579
Last time I saw him
was before he had his stroke.


00:57:27.581 --> 00:57:33.985
So you don't know anything
about him faking his death?


00:57:33.987 --> 00:57:36.854
Well, actually,
I did hear something.


00:57:36.856 --> 00:57:39.023
I heard a few guys
talking about that,


00:57:39.025 --> 00:57:42.360
but I wasn't sure
if it wasn't just talk.


00:57:42.362 --> 00:57:44.297
I wish I could help you.


00:57:45.398 --> 00:57:47.967
I mean, I know I owe you.


00:57:51.104 --> 00:57:52.336
Wait. Do you know...
You know what?


00:57:52.338 --> 00:57:54.105
I don't know, I'm not sure,
but may...


00:57:54.107 --> 00:57:55.940
maybe I did
hear something about his kid


00:57:55.942 --> 00:57:58.278
dumping him in
an old-folk home a while back.


00:57:59.512 --> 00:58:01.247
Thank you.


00:58:06.885 --> 00:58:09.788
Frankie, Frankie, Frankie.
Frankie.


00:58:11.890 --> 00:58:15.025
Hey, look,
I'm really sorry, man.


00:58:15.027 --> 00:58:16.529
About everything.


00:58:52.597 --> 00:58:53.897
Let's see here.


00:58:58.603 --> 00:59:01.438
♪ I am ♪


00:59:01.440 --> 00:59:03.173
♪ Always ♪


00:59:03.175 --> 00:59:06.975
♪ Chasing rainbows ♪


00:59:06.977 --> 00:59:09.079
♪ Watching clouds ♪


00:59:09.081 --> 00:59:11.013
♪ Drifting by ♪


00:59:11.015 --> 00:59:12.482
♪ Ooh ♪


00:59:12.484 --> 00:59:18.020
♪ My schemes
are just like all my dreams ♪


00:59:18.022 --> 00:59:19.988
♪ Ending in ♪


00:59:19.990 --> 00:59:22.991
♪ The sky ♪


00:59:22.993 --> 00:59:25.994
♪ Some fellas look
and find the sunshine ♪


00:59:25.996 --> 00:59:28.665
♪ I always look
and find the rain ♪


00:59:28.667 --> 00:59:31.300
You danced to that song
with Lorraine at your wedding.


00:59:31.302 --> 00:59:34.169
She thought
it was a happy song.


00:59:34.171 --> 00:59:36.038
What the hell
happened to you?


00:59:36.040 --> 00:59:38.140
♪ I was just taking care
of loose ends ♪


00:59:38.142 --> 00:59:40.209
Frank.
Frank, Frank, Frank, look.


00:59:40.211 --> 00:59:42.010
All of the guys
that we came up with


00:59:42.012 --> 00:59:44.146
that didn't get killed,
they all smartened up enough


00:59:44.148 --> 00:59:45.481
to know when
it was time to get out.


00:59:45.483 --> 00:59:47.383
That game of "gang" shit
that we used to play


00:59:47.385 --> 00:59:48.618
is for kids.


00:59:48.620 --> 00:59:50.619
Okay?
And we are not kids anymore.


00:59:50.621 --> 00:59:52.588
♪ I'm not playing anymore
either ♪


00:59:52.590 --> 00:59:54.089
♪ Believe me ♪


00:59:54.091 --> 00:59:56.158
They deserve what
they got coming, okay?


00:59:56.160 --> 00:59:57.559
No question about it.


00:59:57.561 --> 01:00:00.129
- ♪ Chasing rainbows ♪
- But, fuck, hey.


01:00:00.131 --> 01:00:01.330
Is it really worth it?


01:00:01.332 --> 01:00:03.031
Is it going
to change anything?


01:00:03.033 --> 01:00:04.266
♪ Waiting to find ♪


01:00:04.268 --> 01:00:06.635
♪ A little bluebird ♪


01:00:06.637 --> 01:00:08.170
It'll change the fact


01:00:08.172 --> 01:00:10.005
that I'm the only one
that got screwed.


01:00:10.007 --> 01:00:11.373
And what if
you get killed first?


01:00:11.375 --> 01:00:13.475
I mean, look at the state
of you already, man.


01:00:13.477 --> 01:00:15.244
People are
gonna die either way.


01:00:15.246 --> 01:00:16.378
No way around it.


01:00:16.380 --> 01:00:20.382
Just a matter of
who goes next.


01:00:22.253 --> 01:00:25.220
We hurt a lot of people,
you and I.


01:00:25.222 --> 01:00:27.989
Made a lot of bad choices
that now we just


01:00:27.991 --> 01:00:30.559
need to learn to live with.


01:00:30.561 --> 01:00:33.060
Look, why don't you come
to Isha's wedding tomorrow?


01:00:33.062 --> 01:00:35.229
Be a part of some real-life
shit. It'll be good for you.


01:00:35.231 --> 01:00:38.332
You can even bring somebody,
okay? A date.


01:00:38.334 --> 01:00:40.067
Maybe you'll even meet
a nice woman there.


01:00:40.069 --> 01:00:42.069
I don't know.


01:00:42.071 --> 01:00:43.572
Well, think about it.


01:00:43.574 --> 01:00:46.240
We'd love to have you.


01:00:46.242 --> 01:00:47.944
You're family.


01:00:49.145 --> 01:00:51.181
Yeah, maybe.


01:01:38.093 --> 01:01:39.295
Joey?


01:01:41.063 --> 01:01:42.465
Hey, Joey?


01:01:48.771 --> 01:01:51.672
Oh.
Sorry.


01:01:51.674 --> 01:01:54.577
No, it's okay.
Just do your work.


01:02:47.329 --> 01:02:49.498
<i>¿Habla Inglés?</i>


01:03:09.685 --> 01:03:11.150
Uh, hey,


01:03:11.152 --> 01:03:13.252
kid, can you help me
with something?


01:03:13.254 --> 01:03:14.455
Of course, sir.


01:03:22.330 --> 01:03:24.263
I have to call my son,


01:03:24.265 --> 01:03:28.334
and I have no idea how
to work this damn thing.


01:03:28.336 --> 01:03:32.438
Well, uh, I can certainly
help you with that, Mister...?


01:03:32.440 --> 01:03:35.407
- Carver.
- Mr. Carver.


01:03:35.409 --> 01:03:38.777
See, I just find
your address book app.


01:03:38.779 --> 01:03:41.180
Uh, what is your son's name?


01:03:41.182 --> 01:03:42.915
Uh, Joey. Joseph.


01:03:42.917 --> 01:03:46.185
It's, uh... It's empty.


01:03:46.187 --> 01:03:49.521
Oh, yeah. I just
got the thing yesterday.


01:03:49.523 --> 01:03:52.223
Well, has he called you
since, or...


01:03:52.225 --> 01:03:54.860
He, uh, um,


01:03:54.862 --> 01:03:56.729
"face-called" me
yesterday.


01:03:56.731 --> 01:03:58.196
Uh, great.


01:03:58.198 --> 01:03:59.465
So, um,


01:03:59.467 --> 01:04:01.500
I just find the phone app...


01:04:01.502 --> 01:04:02.701
Uh-huh.


01:04:02.703 --> 01:04:04.503
...and go
to your call history.


01:04:04.505 --> 01:04:06.473
- Oh.
- Here. And...


01:04:07.875 --> 01:04:09.675
Yeah, that's empty, too.


01:04:09.677 --> 01:04:11.677
Aw, shit.
Really?


01:04:11.679 --> 01:04:14.980
Maybe you accidentally
cleared it, or...?


01:04:14.982 --> 01:04:17.683
I wouldn't put it past me.


01:04:17.685 --> 01:04:19.550
Is there any way
you can get it back?


01:04:19.552 --> 01:04:21.352
I'm awfully sorry, sir.


01:04:21.354 --> 01:04:23.621
Oh, that's okay.


01:04:23.623 --> 01:04:25.858
Thank you.


01:04:25.860 --> 01:04:28.459
Uh, hey, but you can...


01:04:28.461 --> 01:04:30.828
you can use this thing
to get on the Web, right?


01:04:30.830 --> 01:04:32.296
Most definitely, sir.


01:04:32.298 --> 01:04:34.699
Okay, well, then,
can you look up


01:04:34.701 --> 01:04:37.435
all the nursing homes
in the area...


01:04:37.437 --> 01:04:39.270
no, in the state, actually...


01:04:39.272 --> 01:04:41.439
a-and write me up
a list and...


01:04:41.441 --> 01:04:42.940
Mr. Carver, I can't...


01:04:42.942 --> 01:04:44.678
I'll give you $500.


01:04:46.946 --> 01:04:48.946
L-Let me grab a pad, yeah.


01:04:48.948 --> 01:04:51.351
Good man.


01:05:15.008 --> 01:05:17.242
I'm dying.


01:05:21.047 --> 01:05:24.581
They told me I had


01:05:24.583 --> 01:05:28.320
fatal sporadic insomnia.


01:05:29.555 --> 01:05:31.388
I can't sleep.


01:05:31.390 --> 01:05:34.025
There's something wrong
with my brain.


01:05:34.027 --> 01:05:38.664
It's incurable.


01:05:40.766 --> 01:05:44.803
And untreatable.


01:05:47.439 --> 01:05:49.706
God, I'm...


01:05:49.708 --> 01:05:51.508
I'm sorry, sir.


01:05:51.510 --> 01:05:54.778
Well, at least
I get to take


01:05:54.780 --> 01:05:56.982
a few of them
down with me, right?


01:06:01.053 --> 01:06:03.522
Joey?


01:06:05.357 --> 01:06:07.324
Joey, is that you?


01:06:07.326 --> 01:06:08.492
It's Simone!


01:06:08.494 --> 01:06:10.861
Oh, shit.


01:06:10.863 --> 01:06:13.398
Simone.
Oh, shit.


01:06:22.674 --> 01:06:24.340
Ah!


01:06:24.342 --> 01:06:28.078
Simone!
I'm sorry, honey.


01:06:28.080 --> 01:06:32.348
I forgot about
our dinner plans.


01:06:39.423 --> 01:06:41.925
Hi, sweetie.


01:06:41.927 --> 01:06:43.726
Who are you?


01:06:43.728 --> 01:06:47.130
I'm Simone, baby.
You called me for a date?


01:06:47.132 --> 01:06:50.566
Y-You're not Simone.


01:06:50.568 --> 01:06:54.705
I assure you, honey, I am.


01:06:55.640 --> 01:06:58.507
Mm. You gonna fix me
a drink, or what?


01:06:58.509 --> 01:07:02.611
There's been a mistake.
I called for the other Simone.


01:07:02.613 --> 01:07:05.481
She's this tall,
has dark hair.


01:07:05.483 --> 01:07:06.982
Real name's Jennifer.


01:07:06.984 --> 01:07:08.984
I don't know, baby.
I guess she couldn't make it.


01:07:08.986 --> 01:07:10.586
Hi, cutie.


01:07:10.588 --> 01:07:12.454
It's gonna cost you extra
if he's watching.


01:07:12.456 --> 01:07:13.889
Why?


01:07:13.891 --> 01:07:15.891
Why can't she make it?


01:07:15.893 --> 01:07:20.596
Why are you so stuck
on this other girl, sweetie?


01:07:20.598 --> 01:07:23.032
I'm right here,
and she's not.


01:07:23.034 --> 01:07:25.968
Well, you see, <i>sweetie,</i>


01:07:25.970 --> 01:07:27.837
you're not the girl
I called for,


01:07:27.839 --> 01:07:29.404
so you're gonna
have to leave.


01:07:29.406 --> 01:07:30.873
I'm not fucking you.


01:07:30.875 --> 01:07:33.142
Get your fucking meat paws
off me, you ugly fuck!


01:07:33.144 --> 01:07:36.848
Shut the fuck up and get out,
you phony piece of shit.


01:07:47.091 --> 01:07:50.493
Jesus Christ.
Now what?


01:07:52.829 --> 01:07:54.029
Hello?


01:07:54.031 --> 01:07:55.164
Hey, Frank.


01:07:55.166 --> 01:07:56.798
Yeah?


01:07:56.800 --> 01:07:57.834
It's Trip.


01:07:58.902 --> 01:08:01.636
Aw, come on, don't tell me
you don't remember me.


01:08:01.638 --> 01:08:03.471
From the other day?


01:08:03.473 --> 01:08:05.207
"Expensive car,
expensive suit..."


01:08:05.209 --> 01:08:06.875
Yeah, I remember you.


01:08:06.877 --> 01:08:09.010
So the Presidential Suite, huh?


01:08:09.012 --> 01:08:11.045
How much you have to pay
for a room like that,


01:08:11.047 --> 01:08:12.146
if you don't mind me asking?


01:08:12.148 --> 01:08:13.982
Actually, I do mind.


01:08:15.085 --> 01:08:16.853
That's me.


01:08:25.862 --> 01:08:28.096
Hi, Frank.
Got a minute?


01:08:28.098 --> 01:08:29.197
No.


01:08:29.199 --> 01:08:30.899
Ooh.


01:08:30.901 --> 01:08:32.233
Oh, yeah!


01:08:32.235 --> 01:08:35.003
Look at this place, huh?


01:08:35.005 --> 01:08:37.406
Fucking top tier!


01:08:38.141 --> 01:08:40.808
I hope I can afford
a room like this one day.


01:08:40.810 --> 01:08:43.878
Maybe if I just keep my nose
to the grindstone,


01:08:43.880 --> 01:08:45.813
work hard.


01:08:45.815 --> 01:08:48.249
What do you think, Frank?
You think it'll happen for me?


01:08:48.251 --> 01:08:49.717
Are you gonna whimper
all night,


01:08:49.719 --> 01:08:51.618
or is there something
you want from me?


01:08:51.620 --> 01:08:54.122
I hear you had a little bit of
a problem with one of my girls.


01:08:54.124 --> 01:08:56.224
She wasn't the girl
I called for.


01:08:56.226 --> 01:08:57.557
I called for Simone.


01:08:57.559 --> 01:08:58.927
Yeah, well,
Simone was busy.


01:08:58.929 --> 01:09:00.895
Besides,
you scared the bitch.


01:09:00.897 --> 01:09:02.629
She's afraid of you, Frank.


01:09:02.631 --> 01:09:04.831
- She said that?
- What are you gonna do?


01:09:04.833 --> 01:09:07.734
Women, they're like feral cats.
They spook easy.


01:09:07.736 --> 01:09:10.138
That being said, there's a few
things you and me,


01:09:10.140 --> 01:09:11.505
we need to square up here.


01:09:11.507 --> 01:09:13.707
First of all,


01:09:13.709 --> 01:09:16.877
you can't put your hands
on the lady unless you pay.


01:09:16.879 --> 01:09:18.111
No refunds, no exchanges.


01:09:18.113 --> 01:09:20.147
I didn't touch anyone,


01:09:20.149 --> 01:09:23.717
and if your employee says I did,
she's a liar.


01:09:23.719 --> 01:09:25.218
Now, why would she lie, Frank?


01:09:25.220 --> 01:09:27.587
Uh, because she's a whore?


01:09:27.589 --> 01:09:29.623
I don't know.
You tell me.


01:09:29.625 --> 01:09:31.792
Well, that's not a very nice
thing to say now, is it?


01:09:31.794 --> 01:09:33.860
I'm afraid I'm all out
of niceness, Trip.


01:09:33.862 --> 01:09:36.029
Well, then, give me
what you owe me, and I will go.


01:09:36.031 --> 01:09:39.733
So that's 500 on top
of the $250 cancellation fee,


01:09:39.735 --> 01:09:42.069
just in case the bitch
forgot to mention that.


01:09:42.071 --> 01:09:43.570
But you know what?


01:09:43.572 --> 01:09:45.872
Because I actually
feel sorry for you,


01:09:45.874 --> 01:09:47.908
just give me a thousand
and we are good.


01:09:47.910 --> 01:09:50.143
She's not the girl I called for,
I'm not paying.


01:09:50.145 --> 01:09:52.813
Fuck, Frank!
Do not fuck with me right now!


01:09:52.815 --> 01:09:55.248
I do not need
some sort of fucking ordeal!


01:09:56.885 --> 01:09:58.285
All right, just take it easy.


01:09:58.287 --> 01:10:00.787
Hey, my behavior?
That is completely up to you.


01:10:00.789 --> 01:10:03.789
I have money for you
over here.


01:10:03.791 --> 01:10:05.859
I'm sorry things had to unfold
like this, Frank.


01:10:05.861 --> 01:10:08.328
I mean, you seem like
a real friendly guy and all.


01:10:08.330 --> 01:10:11.697
Frank! Ah! Fuck!


01:10:11.699 --> 01:10:13.100
Shut up!


01:10:13.102 --> 01:10:16.036
- Shut her up!
- Bitch, shut the fuck up!


01:10:16.038 --> 01:10:17.737
Now, listen up, egghead.


01:10:17.739 --> 01:10:19.772
Unless you want your pimp brains


01:10:19.774 --> 01:10:21.807
splattered all over
that chewed-up mutt out there,


01:10:21.809 --> 01:10:23.843
I suggest you


01:10:23.845 --> 01:10:27.580
and your smirking little
Tic Tac, egg-shaped face


01:10:27.582 --> 01:10:30.116
get out of my sight,
or I'll put you to sleep.


01:10:30.118 --> 01:10:31.351
Does this sound like
a fair compromise?


01:10:31.353 --> 01:10:32.852
Yes.


01:10:32.854 --> 01:10:34.253
Okay, you're gonna
have to speak up.


01:10:34.255 --> 01:10:35.621
I'm... I'm very tired.


01:10:35.623 --> 01:10:37.223
Yes! Okay? Yes!


01:10:37.225 --> 01:10:38.624
And if you even think


01:10:38.626 --> 01:10:41.060
about coming back here
to see me,


01:10:41.062 --> 01:10:42.361
I'll kill you.


01:10:42.363 --> 01:10:44.663
And I'll find
everyone you love,


01:10:44.665 --> 01:10:46.165
and I'll kill them too.


01:10:46.167 --> 01:10:47.666
Do you understand?


01:10:47.668 --> 01:10:48.634
Yeah.


01:10:48.636 --> 01:10:49.769
Yeah.


01:10:49.771 --> 01:10:51.003
"Egg-cellent."


01:10:53.674 --> 01:10:55.843
Just go.
Go! Go! Go!


01:10:56.944 --> 01:10:58.880
- How you doing?
- I-I'm done, sir.


01:10:59.747 --> 01:11:01.280
Good.


01:11:01.282 --> 01:11:03.715
No, wait, wait, wait, wait,
wait, wait, wait, wait.


01:11:03.717 --> 01:11:05.617
Catch.


01:11:05.619 --> 01:11:07.955
- Thank you, sir!
- Yeah.


01:11:23.670 --> 01:11:24.836
Yeah?


01:11:24.838 --> 01:11:25.837
Dad?


01:11:25.839 --> 01:11:27.705
Joey, is that you?


01:11:27.707 --> 01:11:29.707
Dad, I'm scared.
I need your help.


01:11:29.709 --> 01:11:32.143
What? Joey?
Joey, I can't hear you.


01:11:32.145 --> 01:11:34.746
Are you still there?


01:11:34.748 --> 01:11:37.383
Joey, tell me where you are.
Hello?


01:11:53.333 --> 01:11:54.732
Joey?


01:11:58.872 --> 01:12:00.171
Joey?


01:12:17.090 --> 01:12:20.824
Joey? Joey?


01:12:20.826 --> 01:12:23.796
Hey! Hey.


01:12:25.698 --> 01:12:27.000
Joey?


01:12:29.402 --> 01:12:31.302
Joey!


01:12:36.176 --> 01:12:38.108
Joey?


01:12:40.913 --> 01:12:42.349
Come on!


01:12:58.797 --> 01:13:00.097
Come on. Let's go.
Come on.


01:13:00.099 --> 01:13:02.332
Put your arm around me.
That's it. Up.


01:13:02.334 --> 01:13:04.036
Okay.


01:13:06.739 --> 01:13:08.874
Keep walking.
Come on.


01:13:26.292 --> 01:13:28.327
Is that warmer?


01:13:33.065 --> 01:13:34.764
It's not
what you're thinking.


01:13:34.766 --> 01:13:36.168
It's okay.


01:13:39.305 --> 01:13:44.106
I know it looks bad, but I've
got it all under control.


01:13:44.108 --> 01:13:45.977
You don't have to worry
about me.


01:13:47.546 --> 01:13:50.547
I don't have to
worry about you?


01:13:50.549 --> 01:13:51.847
That's all I do.


01:13:57.021 --> 01:13:58.490
I'm sorry, Daddy.


01:14:00.526 --> 01:14:01.826
I screwed up.


01:14:03.394 --> 01:14:05.462
It's all my fault.


01:14:05.464 --> 01:14:08.333
Don't do that to yourself.


01:14:09.400 --> 01:14:11.367
It's not your fault.


01:14:11.369 --> 01:14:15.039
It was never your fault.
It was me. It was my fault.


01:14:20.245 --> 01:14:24.013
We were starting to do okay,
me and you.


01:14:24.015 --> 01:14:25.548
We were...
We were getting there.


01:14:25.550 --> 01:14:27.350
And then Max comes along


01:14:27.352 --> 01:14:31.420
and tells me to take the rap
on something that he did,


01:14:31.422 --> 01:14:36.158
and his lawyer tells me
five, six years, tops.


01:14:36.160 --> 01:14:38.027
And even though
you just lost your mother,


01:14:38.029 --> 01:14:40.296
I stupidly, stupidly thought


01:14:40.298 --> 01:14:43.366
that $450,000
would make up for that.


01:14:43.368 --> 01:14:47.336
And six years without Dad...


01:14:47.338 --> 01:14:48.972
Idiot.


01:14:51.108 --> 01:14:52.375
And then they tell me,


01:14:52.377 --> 01:14:54.176
"Well, we're gonna
take care of Joey.


01:14:54.178 --> 01:14:56.545
We're gonna
look out for Joey.


01:14:56.547 --> 01:14:58.381
Six years.
He's all set."


01:14:58.383 --> 01:15:01.484
Six years,
and Joey's a rich man.


01:15:04.522 --> 01:15:07.090
Well, six years
turned into life.


01:15:10.861 --> 01:15:13.462
And what is it that they say?


01:15:13.464 --> 01:15:16.133
The road to hell is paved
with good intentions?


01:15:17.334 --> 01:15:18.802
Yeah.


01:15:21.204 --> 01:15:23.040
That's what they say.


01:15:39.956 --> 01:15:41.291
Thank you.


01:15:43.527 --> 01:15:45.329
Here you go.


01:15:46.596 --> 01:15:47.928
There.


01:15:47.930 --> 01:15:49.230
Careful.


01:15:49.232 --> 01:15:51.533
Probably bruised
a couple of your ribs.


01:15:51.535 --> 01:15:54.104
Might've even fractured one.
All right.


01:15:56.340 --> 01:15:57.374
Looks good.


01:15:59.376 --> 01:16:02.312
And there's something else
I should probably tell you.


01:16:05.649 --> 01:16:08.285
I'm sick...


01:16:11.455 --> 01:16:13.688
...of seeing
that bacon there uneaten.


01:16:16.258 --> 01:16:18.425
- Mmm.
- Hey.


01:16:18.427 --> 01:16:19.561
So good.


01:16:19.563 --> 01:16:21.897
Mmm!


01:16:36.679 --> 01:16:38.712
Been so long
since I've been here,


01:16:38.714 --> 01:16:40.516
I've forgotten where it is.


01:16:43.519 --> 01:16:46.222
Dad!
This way.


01:16:55.231 --> 01:16:57.099
It's beautiful out here,
isn't it?


01:17:01.337 --> 01:17:05.474
Damn.
This kid was only 15 years old.


01:17:13.449 --> 01:17:15.349
Lorrie...


01:17:17.453 --> 01:17:22.389
I'm sorry it took this long
to get here.


01:17:22.391 --> 01:17:25.393
I just want you to know
that we're okay.


01:17:26.529 --> 01:17:29.228
I love you.


01:17:29.230 --> 01:17:31.299
I'll be home soon.


01:17:53.087 --> 01:17:55.354
I just miss you,
that's all.


01:17:57.759 --> 01:17:59.425
I miss...
I miss you so much.


01:17:59.427 --> 01:18:01.294
I'm right here, Dad.
I'm... I'm right here.


01:18:01.296 --> 01:18:03.029
- I know.
- Okay?


01:18:03.031 --> 01:18:07.366
It's just that Max promised me
they'd look out for you.


01:18:07.368 --> 01:18:10.269
H-He... He promised me.


01:18:10.271 --> 01:18:12.505
Dad, you knew what kind
of people they were.


01:18:12.507 --> 01:18:14.507
But... But I gave
my life to them.


01:18:14.509 --> 01:18:16.442
I gave them everything!


01:18:16.444 --> 01:18:19.144
And look... look what
they did to you!


01:18:20.548 --> 01:18:24.417
Remember what
they say about revenge?


01:18:24.419 --> 01:18:26.151
About having to dig
two graves?


01:18:30.290 --> 01:18:32.660
They're gonna have to dig
a lot more than two.


01:18:42.369 --> 01:18:45.203
You said you were doing
this all for me, right?


01:18:45.205 --> 01:18:47.807
- Yes.
- Well...


01:18:47.809 --> 01:18:50.143
Maybe you can do
something else for me instead.


01:18:50.845 --> 01:18:52.079
Walk away.


01:18:53.280 --> 01:18:55.647
- I can't.
- Yes, you can.


01:18:55.649 --> 01:18:58.183
Today's your day
to try again.


01:18:58.185 --> 01:19:01.586
It's that simple.
You just walk away. Start over.


01:19:01.588 --> 01:19:03.555
Find some happiness
for yourself


01:19:03.557 --> 01:19:05.025
for however many days
you have left.


01:19:07.094 --> 01:19:10.063
- I don't deserve happiness.
- Yes, you do.


01:19:11.765 --> 01:19:13.732
So do what I ask.


01:19:13.734 --> 01:19:15.335
Promise me.


01:19:17.871 --> 01:19:19.573
I promise.


01:20:40.820 --> 01:20:43.386
Simone, hi.


01:20:43.388 --> 01:20:44.688
What are you doing here?


01:20:44.690 --> 01:20:46.224
I found your scarf.


01:20:48.460 --> 01:20:50.393
I'm sorry to bother you
at your home.


01:20:50.395 --> 01:20:53.296
I was feeling
a fair amount of regret


01:20:53.298 --> 01:20:55.799
as to how our date
ended the other day.


01:20:55.801 --> 01:20:57.333
I didn't mean to scare you.


01:20:57.335 --> 01:21:00.637
And I should never have
thought or said


01:21:00.639 --> 01:21:01.741
that you and I...


01:21:02.942 --> 01:21:06.275
Well, anyway, I...
I crossed a line.


01:21:06.277 --> 01:21:07.479
I'm sorry.


01:21:08.647 --> 01:21:10.346
That's it.


01:21:10.348 --> 01:21:11.882
It's okay.


01:21:11.884 --> 01:21:13.683
And I have something
for you.


01:21:13.685 --> 01:21:15.785
These flowers?


01:21:15.787 --> 01:21:17.822
Yes. These.


01:21:18.857 --> 01:21:19.924
And that.


01:21:20.993 --> 01:21:22.659
What?
What's that?


01:21:22.661 --> 01:21:26.264
It's money.
There's over $100,000 in there.


01:21:31.836 --> 01:21:33.503
Holy shit!


01:21:33.505 --> 01:21:34.737
It's for you.


01:21:34.739 --> 01:21:35.738
And him.


01:21:35.740 --> 01:21:38.541
Frank, I... I-I can't.


01:21:38.543 --> 01:21:40.610
Please.
I don't need it.


01:21:40.612 --> 01:21:42.478
I don't have anyone else
to give it to.


01:21:42.480 --> 01:21:47.282
So please, just consider it
a-a thank-you


01:21:47.284 --> 01:21:50.655
for being kind
to a stupid old man.


01:21:52.857 --> 01:21:55.694
<i>I don't know what to say.</i>


01:22:04.468 --> 01:22:06.270
Neither do I.


01:22:18.482 --> 01:22:20.649
Oh. Hey, bubba.


01:22:20.651 --> 01:22:23.019
Um, this is my friend, Frank.


01:22:23.021 --> 01:22:24.886
- Hi.
- Hi.


01:22:24.888 --> 01:22:26.958
What's your name?


01:22:28.358 --> 01:22:29.526
Joey.


01:22:36.800 --> 01:22:38.402
Of course.


01:22:41.038 --> 01:22:43.605
Bye, Joey.


01:22:43.607 --> 01:22:44.673
Bye, Simone.


01:22:44.675 --> 01:22:46.477
Jennifer.


01:23:39.462 --> 01:23:41.962
I'm so happy
that you're here.


01:23:41.964 --> 01:23:45.366
Poor Mr. Max, he doesn't
get hardly any visitors.


01:23:45.368 --> 01:23:47.434
Really only one
that I can think of


01:23:47.436 --> 01:23:50.437
in the last eight years.


01:23:50.439 --> 01:23:52.807
It's been much longer than that
since I've seen him.


01:23:52.809 --> 01:23:55.075
Well, I'll bet he'll be
real surprised you're here.


01:23:55.077 --> 01:23:57.313
Yes.
I bet he will.


01:24:04.620 --> 01:24:07.355
Hi, Max.
Can we come in?


01:24:14.130 --> 01:24:17.463
Looking good today.


01:24:17.465 --> 01:24:20.435
Did you have a restful night?


01:24:21.536 --> 01:24:22.905
How long
has he been like this?


01:24:24.907 --> 01:24:26.374
Oh, you didn't know?


01:24:28.476 --> 01:24:30.412
About 15 years.


01:24:32.148 --> 01:24:34.816
I'm sorry you had
to find out this way.


01:24:36.185 --> 01:24:37.952
Max.


01:24:37.954 --> 01:24:40.154
Frank Carver is here.


01:24:40.156 --> 01:24:42.024
Frankie.


01:24:43.658 --> 01:24:45.625
Frankie.


01:24:45.627 --> 01:24:47.429
You remember him, right?


01:24:48.830 --> 01:24:50.797
Hey, Uncle.


01:24:50.799 --> 01:24:54.500
Been a long time.


01:24:54.502 --> 01:24:56.903
Well, I'll leave
you two alone.


01:24:56.905 --> 01:24:59.507
Let me know
if you need anything.


01:25:34.109 --> 01:25:36.144
19 years...


01:25:37.778 --> 01:25:39.080
...and I kept my mouth shut.


01:25:40.215 --> 01:25:44.217
I held up
my end of the bargain


01:25:44.219 --> 01:25:46.620
even though
I thought you didn't.


01:25:53.827 --> 01:25:56.097
But it turns out
you would've.


01:25:58.532 --> 01:26:00.966
Or I'd like to think
you would have.


01:26:00.968 --> 01:26:02.770
Either way...


01:26:04.038 --> 01:26:06.272
...I'm sorry


01:26:06.274 --> 01:26:08.208
I've been blaming you...


01:26:09.276 --> 01:26:11.009
...while you've been here...


01:26:12.212 --> 01:26:13.647
...like this.


01:26:18.986 --> 01:26:20.220
Bye, Max.


01:26:25.960 --> 01:26:27.693
Excuse me.


01:26:27.695 --> 01:26:29.628
Can I ask you a question?


01:26:29.630 --> 01:26:30.996
Of course, Mr. Carver.


01:26:30.998 --> 01:26:33.999
You mentioned that
one visitor that Max had?


01:26:34.001 --> 01:26:37.235
Yeah, he came in regularly
for a good chunk of time there,


01:26:37.237 --> 01:26:39.771
but we haven't seen him
in a long while.


01:26:39.773 --> 01:26:41.605
Do you happen
to remember his name?


01:26:41.607 --> 01:26:44.109
No.
Sorry, I don't.


01:26:44.111 --> 01:26:46.144
He was
a real friendly guy, though.


01:26:46.146 --> 01:26:49.281
All of us just called him
by his first initial.


01:26:49.283 --> 01:26:51.551
Q.


01:27:08.302 --> 01:27:10.134
Hey, Frankie!


01:27:10.136 --> 01:27:12.038
Took you long enough
to find this place, huh?


01:27:13.573 --> 01:27:15.673
Are you checking in
or what?


01:27:15.675 --> 01:27:19.043
Hey, baby, I heard they have
really nice amenities in there.


01:27:19.045 --> 01:27:22.713
Water aerobics, bingo night.


01:27:22.715 --> 01:27:24.917
All the tapioca pudding
you can eat.


01:27:29.956 --> 01:27:32.256
I always liked you, Frankie!


01:27:32.258 --> 01:27:34.892
You always had
a good attitude about the job.


01:27:34.894 --> 01:27:36.794
If you were meant
to die that day,


01:27:36.796 --> 01:27:39.196
you were meant to die that day!


01:27:39.198 --> 01:27:41.032
But you know what?


01:27:41.034 --> 01:27:43.036
You are gonna die today!


01:27:57.682 --> 01:28:00.585
Well, Frankie,
I guess it's my day, huh?


01:28:04.956 --> 01:28:07.824
They won't be calling you
the Dragon anymore.


01:28:40.325 --> 01:28:42.325
Hey, Doris.
Good to see you.


01:28:42.327 --> 01:28:44.794
Hey, Cal. See you
on the dance floor, buddy.


01:28:44.796 --> 01:28:45.862
All right.


01:28:45.864 --> 01:28:47.097
Hey, you nervous?


01:28:47.099 --> 01:28:48.431
Guess what?
You're gonna be next.


01:28:48.433 --> 01:28:49.933
Let me straighten out
your tie.


01:28:49.935 --> 01:28:51.801
Go easy on the ladies
tonight, right?


01:28:51.803 --> 01:28:54.104
Make sure that, uh...
make sure you have fun.


01:28:57.675 --> 01:28:58.908
Hey, how are you?


01:28:58.910 --> 01:29:00.243
Good to see you.
I'm glad you're here.


01:29:00.245 --> 01:29:01.978
Hi, guys.
How are you?


01:29:01.980 --> 01:29:04.447
- <i>¿Carolina, cómo está?</i>
- <i>¿Bien, e tu?</i>


01:29:04.449 --> 01:29:07.083
Hey, listen, you owe me a dance
later, okay. All right?


01:29:07.085 --> 01:29:08.118
I will dance with you.


01:29:08.120 --> 01:29:09.187
Hey, guys.


01:29:12.290 --> 01:29:14.792
How are you?
I'm glad you made it.


01:29:18.062 --> 01:29:19.795
Listen, man,
you bring my money?


01:29:19.797 --> 01:29:20.929
It's in the mail.


01:29:20.931 --> 01:29:22.398
All right.


01:29:25.903 --> 01:29:27.370
Hey, what happened?


01:29:27.372 --> 01:29:29.240
Hey, what's the matter?


01:29:34.745 --> 01:29:38.249
Isha, sweetheart, it's Dad.
Are you okay?


01:29:40.718 --> 01:29:41.917
Ish?


01:29:41.919 --> 01:29:43.888
Yes, I'm fine.


01:29:45.789 --> 01:29:47.658
Are you sure?


01:29:49.927 --> 01:29:51.829
You should come in.


01:29:54.798 --> 01:29:56.999
Baby?
What's the matter?


01:29:57.001 --> 01:29:59.236
Close the door.


01:30:00.304 --> 01:30:02.070
Frankie, what are you...
what are you doing?


01:30:02.072 --> 01:30:04.139
I said close the door.


01:30:04.141 --> 01:30:07.075
Please, not... not here, okay?
Not like this.


01:30:07.077 --> 01:30:09.344
Close the goddamn door.


01:30:09.346 --> 01:30:11.846
Okay, okay! Just... Just
let's... let's just calm down.


01:30:11.848 --> 01:30:14.283
I am calm.
Just do what I fucking say.


01:30:14.285 --> 01:30:16.151
Isha, are you all right,
sweetheart?


01:30:16.153 --> 01:30:17.785
Did he hurt you?


01:30:17.787 --> 01:30:19.722
Get out.


01:30:21.158 --> 01:30:23.258
It's okay. It's all right.
His beef is with me.


01:30:23.260 --> 01:30:24.827
Beef?


01:30:25.895 --> 01:30:28.829
Beef?!


01:30:28.831 --> 01:30:31.233
You have my son killed,


01:30:31.235 --> 01:30:34.137
you lie straight to my face
about it...


01:30:35.306 --> 01:30:38.839
...and you think
I've got <i>beef</i> with you?


01:30:38.841 --> 01:30:39.874
I didn't mean...


01:30:39.876 --> 01:30:40.908
Isha...


01:30:42.979 --> 01:30:45.079
You think "beef"


01:30:45.081 --> 01:30:48.816
is an accurate description


01:30:48.818 --> 01:30:50.418
of what I've got
with your father?!


01:30:50.420 --> 01:30:52.286
Okay. Okay.


01:30:52.288 --> 01:30:53.287
I'm sorry.


01:30:53.289 --> 01:30:55.256
I misspoke.


01:30:55.258 --> 01:30:57.792
Did you really kill Joey?


01:30:57.794 --> 01:31:00.428
Yes, he did.
Now get out.


01:31:00.430 --> 01:31:02.263
- Why? So you can kill him?
- I said get out!


01:31:02.265 --> 01:31:03.166
Just go. Go.
Go, go.


01:31:05.134 --> 01:31:07.868
<i>Hey, Frank.
Frank...</i>


01:31:07.870 --> 01:31:09.971
<i>That looks serious.</i>


01:31:09.973 --> 01:31:12.073
<i>You've lost a lot of blood.</i>


01:31:12.075 --> 01:31:13.374
<i>Why don't we just...</i>


01:31:13.376 --> 01:31:14.976
<i>Hey, why don't we just...</i>


01:31:14.978 --> 01:31:16.577
<i>Why don't we just
put the gun down,</i>


01:31:16.579 --> 01:31:18.045
<i>and we can get you
to a doctor?</i>


01:31:18.047 --> 01:31:19.879
<i>All right?
Hey, Frank, Frank.</i>


01:31:19.881 --> 01:31:21.915
<i>Put the gun down.</i>


01:31:23.486 --> 01:31:25.253
Son of a bitch!


01:31:26.955 --> 01:31:30.191
So Max
falls in a coma,


01:31:30.193 --> 01:31:33.994
you take over,


01:31:33.996 --> 01:31:36.965
keep people thinking
it's still him?


01:31:37.966 --> 01:31:39.333
Yes.


01:31:39.335 --> 01:31:42.603
Well, how's murdering my son
fit into that?


01:31:42.605 --> 01:31:46.039
You think I wanted to do that?
Of course I didn't.


01:31:46.041 --> 01:31:49.342
I loved that kid,
and you know I did.


01:31:49.344 --> 01:31:51.079
But he was a liability.


01:31:54.416 --> 01:31:55.851
He was a junkie, Frank!


01:31:59.622 --> 01:32:01.988
<i>You guys, you're good?</i>


01:32:04.326 --> 01:32:06.059
<i>Why don't you wait around
the block, all right?</i>


01:32:06.061 --> 01:32:07.394
He wasn't that bad.


01:32:07.396 --> 01:32:09.529
Aw, come on!
Don't lie to yourself!


01:32:09.531 --> 01:32:11.166
He was a fucking dope fiend!


01:32:12.868 --> 01:32:16.303
He came all strung out,
demanding cash, drugs,


01:32:16.305 --> 01:32:18.271
threatening, if he didn't
get what he wanted,


01:32:18.273 --> 01:32:20.340
he was gonna go to the cops
and rat us all out.


01:32:20.342 --> 01:32:22.542
All of us!


01:32:22.544 --> 01:32:25.245
For everything!


01:32:25.247 --> 01:32:27.614
<i>We don't know. He's jonesing.
He's likely to say anything.</i>


01:32:27.616 --> 01:32:28.947
<i>He just said he would.</i>


01:32:28.949 --> 01:32:30.517
<i>We don't make decisions.</i>


01:32:30.519 --> 01:32:32.920
<i>We just got to do
what we're told.</i>


01:32:33.988 --> 01:32:35.823
So I had no choice.


01:32:38.126 --> 01:32:41.062
I did what I had to do
to take care of the business.


01:32:41.663 --> 01:32:43.496
And I know you understand that,


01:32:43.498 --> 01:32:44.997
because if you were me,


01:32:44.999 --> 01:32:48.067
you would've done
exactly the same thing.


01:32:48.069 --> 01:32:50.670
I mean, you went
to prison, right?


01:32:50.672 --> 01:32:54.006
You gave up
your whole fucking life


01:32:54.008 --> 01:32:55.943
for the business.


01:33:24.305 --> 01:33:27.940
You should've helped him.


01:33:27.942 --> 01:33:30.542
You were supposed to
look out for him!


01:33:30.544 --> 01:33:32.044
<i>You</i> should've
looked after him!


01:33:32.046 --> 01:33:34.348
You were his father.


01:33:36.016 --> 01:33:37.951
He was dead
the minute you left.


01:33:52.700 --> 01:33:55.434
I'm sorry, Frank.


01:33:55.436 --> 01:33:58.704
If I could go back.
But I can't.


01:34:00.206 --> 01:34:04.144
So I just got to
try to live with it.


01:34:05.178 --> 01:34:07.113
And try to do better now.


01:34:29.335 --> 01:34:32.472
"Today is your day
to try again."


01:35:34.600 --> 01:35:37.569
<i>Come out slowly
with your hands in the air!</i>


01:35:39.738 --> 01:35:41.507
<i>I said hands up!</i>


01:35:44.176 --> 01:35:46.311
<i>Stay where you are!</i>


01:35:47.713 --> 01:35:50.280
<i>Get down on the ground.</i>


01:35:50.282 --> 01:35:51.548
<i>Down on the ground!</i>


01:35:51.550 --> 01:35:53.350
<i>Right now!</i>


01:35:53.352 --> 01:35:56.253
<i>Not another step,
or we'll shoot!</i>


01:35:56.255 --> 01:35:59.222
<i>Now get down on the ground
with your hands on your head.</i>


01:35:59.224 --> 01:36:00.425
<i>Don't move!</i>


01:36:03.094 --> 01:36:05.631
<i>Gun! Gun!
He's got a gun!</i>


01:36:52.410 --> 01:36:54.810
Well, this situation
kind of sucks, doesn't it?


01:36:57.548 --> 01:36:59.815
So what are you
gonna do now?


01:36:59.817 --> 01:37:04.088
Ask God
to forgive me.


01:37:07.291 --> 01:37:10.194
Why are you still here?


01:37:10.861 --> 01:37:12.361
I don't know.


01:37:12.363 --> 01:37:15.229
I thought we could
hang out a bit more.


01:37:15.231 --> 01:37:18.336
I'd like that.

